Presentation Guidelines

    Total presentation time: 7 minutes
        Problem statement
        Algorithm used (If any)
        Justification for the approach
        Cost implications / trade-offs (If any for students working with LLM APIs)
        Evaluation
        Demo
        Conclusion
    Followed by 3 minutes for questions

Please upload your presentation files here. I will need the files at least 24 hours before your scheduled presentation slot, as posted on Canvas under the Project 2 module.
The code and report will be submitted separately in a different Dropbox.
Students who fail to submit their presentation files at least 24 hours in advance will lose the full 20 points.
During the presentation, students must clearly address the problem, the algorithm chosen, the results (visualization of the results if any or artifacts), and future work. The presentation should be concise and focused, with a maximum duration of 7 minutes, followed by 3 minutes for questions. Presentations must be clear, well-structured, and to the point.